// 營利事業所得稅查核準則 §88(2)(1): up to NT$3,000 a month is not salary income; this row stays out of SALARY_INCOME.
// 勞工請假規則 §7: no wage for a no-pay day, so the exempt meal falls with ctx.paid_share.
return Math.min(Number(get(ctx.subject.employment.terms, 'allowances.MEAL_ALLOWANCE.amount', 0)), ctx.lookup.meal_exempt_monthly) * ctx.paid_share;
